{{also|fuckup|fuck-up}}
==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈfʌkˌʌp/|lang=en}} (noun)
* {{IPA|/ˌfʌkˈʌp/|lang=en}} (verb)

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|fuck-up}} ''(UK, noun)''
* {{l|en|fuckup}} ''(US regional, noun)''

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|vulgar}} An [[incompetent]] individual; one who errs frequently.
#: ''He is such a '''fuck up'''.''
# {{lb|en|vulgar}} A severe mistake.
#: ''That '''fuck up''' cost us the contract.''

